      "role": "user",
      "content": "interesting. so it's less about debating whether this happens and more about how we manage the fallout. \n\ni'm trying to figure out if there's actually any serious ground for the argument that we could actually pause or redirect this. like, is there even a valid debate to be had about human agency here, or is the \"policy choice\" argument just kind of a myth used to make people feel like they have control?",
